, held that criminal  conspiracy, in terms of Section 120B, IPC, is  an independent offence and its ingredients  are:
 (i) an agreement between two or more  persons;
 19 Crl.R.P.No.22/2024 (ii) the agreement must relate to doing or causing to be done either - (a) an illegal act;
(b) an act which is not illegal in itself but is also done by illegal means.
